  "description": "YITAMOTOR Skid Steer 3 Point Adapter Plate with 2'' Trailer Hitch Receiver, Universal Quick Attach Mount Plate Adjustable Width Lift Arms from 8\" to 43\" for Front Loader Case\nFitment\nUniversal 3-point adapter fits most category 1 attachments. Compatible with skid steers, track loaders, compact wheel loaders, backhoes, and tractors featuring universal quick-attach mounts\nIt can be used to shovel snow, clear debris, transport waste, and you can get the job done fast.\nFor your safety, professional installation recommended.\nFeatures\nEasy Installation\nThe skid steer 3-point adapter board can be quickly welded or bolted to heavy-duty equipment, this easy attachment greatly saves your time and energy.\nAdjustable Lift Arms\nThe lift arm can help you adjust the width you want, its adjustable width is 8\" - 43\".\nSuperior Steel Material\nThe 3/8\" thick quick attachment mount plate is made of grade 50 structural steel corrosion resistance.\nComplete Accessories\nProduct accessories fix the product on the machine without loosening, it is the premise that the product works.",
